e,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"# Summary\r\n\r\nExpander in sidebar cuts off sliders and potentially other stuff\r\n\r\n# Steps to reproduce\r\nRun the following code\r\n```\r\nimport streamlit as st\r\n\r\nsidebar_expander = st.sidebar.beta_expander(\"Bad sliders underneath!\")\r\nwith sidebar_expander:\r\n    st.slider(\"Bad layout slider 1\", 0, 100, value=0)\r\n    st.slider(\"Bad layout slider 2\", 0, 100, value=(0,100))\r\n\r\nst.sidebar.slider(\"Good layout slider\")\r\n```\r\n## Expected behavior:\r\n\r\nSliders appear nicely under the expander\r\n\r\n## Actual behavior:\r\n\r\nSliders ends are cut off under the expander (see picture)\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/62385461/96776145-e4638580-13e8-11eb-9eaf-692c45541cf1.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n## Is this a regression?\r\n\r\nNo\r\n\r\n# Debug info\r\n\r\n- Streamlit version:  0.69.1\r\n- Python version: 3.8.2\r\n- Using PipEnv\r\n- OS version: Windows 10\r\n- Browser version: Firefox and Chrome, recent versions\r\n\r\n# Additional information\r\n\r\nMay also happen in containers outside of sidebar? Have not checked it though..","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/2247/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/2247/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":4223571013,"node_id":"MDE1OlJlZmVyZW5jZWRFdmVudDQyMjM1NzEwMTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/streamlit/streamlit/issues/events/4223571013","actor":{"login":"akrolsmir","id":856034,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NjAzNA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/856034?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akrolsmir","html_url":"https://github.com/akrolsmir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akrolsmir/followers","following_url":"https://api.g